From: Yofuness <compiledchickennuggets@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:56:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] sunfish: sensor HID services, sweetmotion=MASK (off by
 default), sweetmotion_axes= (0228)

Ported from ios-redfin 0971 (MIT). Changes: default mask 0 instead of 0x77;
accel axis permutation/sign boot-arg sweetmotion_axes (default xyz = redfin's).
